# Env contract for {{PROJECT}}: key names, comments, safe defaults. Never real values.
# Fill .env.local from the ATLAS secret store with:
#   node .claude/scripts/secrets.cjs link{{PROJECT_ARG}}
# Store a value once, yourself (it never appears in chat): in your own terminal
#   node .claude/scripts/secrets.cjs set KEY{{PROJECT_FLAG}}
# or from Claude Code after copying it:  ! pbpaste | node .claude/scripts/secrets.cjs set KEY{{PROJECT_FLAG}}

# DATABASE_URL=
